---
// ContactSection.astro
---

<section id="contact" class="py-24 bg-white relative border-t border-[#F1F5F9]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#0F172A] to-[#1E293B] rounded-[36px] p-8 sm:p-14 text-white shadow-2xl shadow-[#6366F1]/10 relative overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Ambient light effect -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-[#6366F1]/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center relative z-10">
        
        <!-- Left info -->
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-[#818CF8] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
            <span>👋 Contáctanos</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-tight">
            ¿Listo para construir algo extraordinario?
          </h2>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#94A3B8] leading-relaxed">
            Ya sea que quieras probar la beta privada de <strong class="text-white font-semibold">DuoLedger</strong> o necesites un equipo de ingeniería para hacer realidad tu próxima aplicación móvil, conversemos.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
            <a
              href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola%20equipo%20de%20VibeCraft,%20quiero%20conversar%20sobre%20un%20proyecto."
              target="_blank"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:text-[#818CF8] transition-colors"
            >
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#10B981]/20 text-[#34D399] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
                💬
              </div>
              <span>Atención Rápida por WhatsApp</span>
            </a>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-[#94A3B8]">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base">
                ⚡
              </div>
              <span>Respuesta en menos de 24 horas</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Quick Action / Card -->
        <div class="bg-white/5 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Envíanos un Mensaje</h3>
          
          <form class="space-y-4" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('¡Gracias por tu mensaje! Nos pondremos en contacto contigo a la brevedad.');">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#94A3B8] mb-1">Tu Nombre</label>
              <input
                type="text"
                required
                placeholder="Ej. Alexander"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6366F1] transition-all"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#94A3B8] mb-1">Correo Electrónico</label>
              <input
                type="email"
                required
                placeholder="alex@ejemplo.com"
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/10 border border-white/15 text-white placeholder-white/40 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6366F1] transition-all"
              />
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-[#94A3B8] mb-1">Tipo de Interés</label>
              <select
                class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#1E293B] border border-white/15 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-[#6366F1] transition-all"
              >
                <option value="duoledger">Probar DuoLedger (Beta)</option>
                <option value="custom_app">Desarrollo de App a Medida</option>
                <option value="quotecraft">Interés en QuoteCraft</option>
                <option value="other">Otro asunto</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <button
              type="submit"
              class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6366F1] to-[#F43F5E] text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-[#6366F1]/30 hover:opacity-95 transition-opacity"
            >
              Enviar Mensaje
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
